cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the method it implements, given under
  preferred-citation.
type: software
title: "USR: Ultrafast Shape Recognition"
abstract: >-
  A Python implementation of Ultrafast Shape Recognition (USR) on top of RDKit.
  USR describes the shape of a 3D conformer with 12 moments of its atomic
  distance distributions and compares shapes without aligning them. The
  package calculates USR moments from SD files or RDKit molecules and screens
  a database of moments against query molecules, from Python or the `usr`
  command line.
authors:
